00:14:47.020 --> 00:14:49.330
Next slide, please.

00:14:49.330 --> 00:14:53.920
So on a partnership.

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:55.830
That's what all of this about.

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:59.010
Curt and MIT, we're
talking relationship,

00:14:59.010 --> 00:15:00.960
