00:15:38.280 --> 00:15:39.660
How do we expand?

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:42.740
Everyone, we have a motto.

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:45.740
So it's not just, oh,
we're going to inform,

00:15:45.740 --> 00:15:48.020
or we're going to be strategic.

00:15:48.020 --> 00:15:52.850
We are piloting what we call
our OER campus implementation.

00:15:52.850 --> 00:15:56.360
We know it has to start and
be supported from the top.

00:15:56.360 --> 00:15:58.980
But we have to talk
about sustainability.

00:15:58.980 --> 00:16:03.590
We have to talk about how
do you engage your faculty.

00:16:03.590 --> 00:16:06.830
And beyond that, we're
talking community here.

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:08.400
We're talking the world.

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:10.050
How do we get it out?

00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:14.180
So we include, as you
see, an adoption plan

00:16:14.180 --> 00:16:17.950
