HBCU OER librarian curator.

00:44:18.850 --> 00:44:22.720
I usually help coordinate
strategies and tips,

00:44:22.720 --> 00:44:28.420
and find curated resources for
all of the HBCU librarians,

00:44:28.420 --> 00:44:32.770
to help keep OER systems readily
available to your faculty,

00:44:32.770 --> 00:44:36.760
to your students, on all
of the HBCU campuses.

00:44:36.760 --> 00:44:40.780
And throughout the year, the
