00:45:14.890 --> 00:45:18.460
And we just discussed the
OER cultural collection,

00:45:18.460 --> 00:45:22.180
which provides a
wealth of information,

00:45:22.180 --> 00:45:25.030
from exploring African-American
and Black study

00:45:25.030 --> 00:45:27.580
collection and
[INAUDIBLE],, to exploring

00:45:27.580 --> 00:45:33.760
free open educational resources
related to African topics,

00:45:33.760 --> 00:45:39.040
exploring OER on diversity,
equity, and inclusiveness.

00:45:39.040 --> 00:45:43.120
But our initial priority
is to build the OER

00:45:43.120 --> 00:45:44.590
