00:46:06.910 --> 00:46:10.480
So uploading information to
their website is the key.

00:46:10.480 --> 00:46:15.500
It's visible to not just to
HBCU users, but to the world.

00:46:15.500 --> 00:46:19.330
And I try to recognize our
strengths and weaknesses

00:46:19.330 --> 00:46:21.460
